## PHP Standards Recommendations (PSR)

All PHP code must comply with the following PSRs ([php-fig.org/psr](https://www.php-fig.org/psr/)):

- **PSR-1**: Basic coding standard — file encoding, class naming, method naming.
- **PSR-4**: Autoloading standard — managed by Composer. Always use Composer's autoloader. Never manually `require` class files.
- **PSR-12**: Extended coding style — indentation (4 spaces), brace placement, spacing, line length.

